### VS Code 安装 REST Client 插件后，可逐段执行；也可以改写为 curl。

### 1. 查看集群状态
GET http://localhost:9200/_cluster/health

### 2. 查看 products 的 Mapping
GET http://localhost:9200/products/_mapping

### 3. 按 ID 查询
GET http://localhost:9200/products/_doc/5

### 4. 全文搜索：match 会对查询文本进行分析
POST http://localhost:9200/products/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": {
      "description": "搜索引擎"
    }
  }
}

### 5. term 是精确匹配，通常用于 keyword、数字、状态值
POST http://localhost:9200/products/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "term": {
      "category": "图书"
    }
  }
}

### 6. bool 组合过滤条件
POST http://localhost:9200/products/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {"match": {"description": "蓝牙"}}
      ],
      "filter": [
        {"range": {"price": {"lte": 300}}},
        {"range": {"stock": {"gt": 0}}}
      ]
    }
  },
  "sort": [
    {"price": "asc"}
  ]
}

### 7. 聚合：按类别计数并计算平均价格
POST http://localhost:9200/products/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 0,
  "aggs": {
    "by_category": {
      "terms": {"field": "category"},
      "aggs": {
        "avg_price": {"avg": {"field": "price"}}
      }
    }
  }
}

### 8. 查看分词结果，帮助理解倒排索引
POST http://localhost:9200/products/_analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "field": "description",
  "text": "学习全文检索和分布式搜索引擎"
}

### 9. 查看索引及分片
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/indices?v

### 10. 查看分片分布
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/shards/products?v

